 2.2 The intersection of all $E_\varepsilon$ is the diagonal, since $d(x,y)>0$ for $x\ne y$ and $E_{d(x,y)/2}$ excludes $(x,y)$; hence the uniformity is separated. [L1, step 1.1]
 
