 ## Statement
 
-**Assuming dependent choice,** a topological space is separated-uniformizable if and only if it is Tychonoff.
+**Assuming dependent choice,** a nonempty topological space is separated-uniformizable if and only if it is Tychonoff.
 
 ## Facts & Assumptions
 
