items/ex-pointwise-but-not-uniform-convergence-on-a-countable-domain.md:21:Give $\{0,1\}$ the uniformity of its zero-one metric. For $n,k\in\mathbb N$, let $f_n(k)=1$ when $k\ge n$ and $f_n(k)=0$ otherwise. Then $f_n$ converges pointwise, but not uniformly, to the zero function.
