+[L5] Every Hausdorff space is $T_1$ ([[lem-urysohn-sits-between-hausdorff-and-regular-plus-t1]], clause 2).
+
+[L6] In a $T_1$ space every singleton is closed ([[thm-t1-iff-singletons-are-closed]], clause (b)).
